From db2ce89c8cb4260661f86720f607455a0133aa6a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: illuminus5 <2672794+illuminus5@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 20:07:18 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Learn Skiff: chapter 5 on 2.1.1 with QUANTIZE SOLO;
 chapter 21, chord follow, written and filmed
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Keys, scales and the arp is filmed again on 2.1.1 with three new steps: the black keys on QUANTIZE SOLO, two
hands (a chord on the white keys, a tune on the black ones) and a tune over the latched arp, with the key map
drawn in A minor. Chord follow is chapter 21, read after chapter 8 at the end of MAKE MUSIC: a bass line written
once in its own key and moved by another track's chords on SEL › FOLLOW, what the page shows, MODE KEY, SCALE
and FIT, which note of the chord counts, an arp over the chords, chords played live from the keys and a tune on
SOLO's black keys above them. Every step in full, with its video, its time in it and a still of the screen.

The page counts 21 chapters; chapter 8 leads on to 21, and 21 to 9. The glossary has FOLLOW, and SEL's row
names it.
