@@ -2059,6 +2156,7 @@ footer p { max-width: 1240px; margin: 6px auto; }
     <dt id="g-selection">Selection</dt><dd>What the knobs edit on NOTES and FEEL: the cursor's step, or a range of steps (SHIFT + <kbd>PRESETS</kbd>). With REC off a key picks one of its notes. SHIFT + OCT− and OCT+ copy and paste it, SHIFT + EDIT deletes it.</dd>
     <dt id="g-pattern">Pattern</dt><dd>A track's notes exactly as they play: its steps, each note's own length, LENGTH, DIV, SWING, GATE, direction, automation and locks. Kept by itself; 64 of them in a pool every project shares.</dd>
     <dt id="g-list">List and entry</dt><dd>Each track has a list of 16 entries, A–P. An entry names a pattern and how many times it plays (REPS). The lists are the song, and PERFORM's keys.</dd>
+    <dt id="g-follow">Chord follow</dt><dd>A track on FOLLOW plays in another track's chords. SEL's third page: <a href="#chord-follow">chapter 21</a>.</dd>
     <dt id="g-chain">Chain</dt><dd>Entries on CHAIN (SONG's <kbd>KNOB 3</kbd> below 1x) go on into the next: the track plays and edits them as one long pattern.</dd>
     <dt id="g-lock">Lock</dt><dd>A step's own value for a control: hold the step and turn a knob.</dd>
     <dt id="g-take">Take</dt><dd>SHIFT + SAVE keeps the loop you just played as the track's pattern, whether or not REC was on.</dd>
@@ -2108,7 +2206,7 @@ footer p { max-width: 1240px; margin: 6px auto; }
       <tr data-ctrl="PRESETS"><th scope="row"><kbd>PRESETS</kbd></th><td>The track's sound. On NOTES and FEEL: the step cursor (SHIFT + PRESETS: a range); on PATTERN: the direction. In lists: the row.</td><td class="in"></td></tr>
       <tr data-ctrl="KNOB1"><th scope="row"><kbd>KNOB 1</kbd>–<kbd>KNOB 4</kbd></th><td>The four cards across the top of the page.</td><td class="in"></td></tr>
       <tr data-ctrl="FX"><th scope="row"><kbd>FX</kbd></th><td>Tap: the track's effects, SLICER and DUCK. Hold: the FX layer.</td><td class="in"></td></tr>
-      <tr data-ctrl="SEL"><th scope="row"><kbd>SEL</kbd></th><td>Tap: SCALE and CHORD. Hold: a key sets the root.</td><td class="in"></td></tr>
+      <tr data-ctrl="SEL"><th scope="row"><kbd>SEL</kbd></th><td>Tap: SCALE, CHORD and FOLLOW. Hold: a key sets the root.</td><td class="in"></td></tr>
       <tr data-ctrl="ENV"><th scope="row"><kbd>ENV</kbd></th><td>The envelopes, ENV and ENV 2.</td><td class="in"></td></tr>
       <tr data-ctrl="LFO"><th scope="row"><kbd>LFO</kbd></th><td>Tap: LFO, LFO 2 and MOD, where the LFO and the envelope go. Hold: MOMENTARY.</td><td class="in"></td></tr>
